{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39720","headline":"湘中赠张逸人 · 黄滔","name":"湘中赠张逸人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽衣零落帽欹斜，不自孤峰即海沙。\n曾爲蜀山成寓迹，又因湘水拟营家。\n鸣琴坐见燕鸿没，曳履吟忘野迳赊。\n更爱扁舟宿寒夜，独听风雨过芦花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}